The agent-detection manifests in this directory are copied from the Herdr
project (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

HERDR_COMMIT records the Herdr commit they were copied from. To update them,
run `make sync-agent-manifests` (HERDR_REF=<branch, tag or commit> pins a
version; the default is Herdr's default branch). It mirrors
herdr/src/detect/manifests/ here and runs the terminal tests, which fail on
any rule feature the engine does not implement.
The files are embedded and compiled at build time; maiD performs no remote
manifest updates.
